** MACHINE LEARNING **

Unencumbred by human supervision, behaviour analysis could now be done at machine speed, and could adapt to the ever-changing attributes of threat.
Other security feautres that were added to firewalls include the following:

- Distributed denial of service (DDoS) defense
- IP reputation
- ANtivirus
- Data loss prevention (DLP)

